Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.68,0:00:03.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.58,0:00:05.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的一集马上就要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.08,0:00:07.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了找齐四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.79,0:00:10.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了用这把铁碎牙打败奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.29,0:00:11.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有找寻奈落的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:13.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都集结到了白灵山
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.42,0:00:15.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最强也是最后的一道防线
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:17.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七人帮的蛮骨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.19,0:00:19.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也出现在犬夜叉的面前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:21.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 珊瑚 七宝跟云母
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.83,0:00:23.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿梭于时空 发生在战国时代与现代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.93,0:00:24.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.34,0:00:31.97,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分散在蓝蓝天空上的 七颗星星{\fad(300,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:37.00,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每一颗星星 都刻着我的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.15,0:00:40.98,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算梦想被粉碎 我也要寻找爱{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:45.02,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无处可逃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:49.02,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧紧抓着我的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.16,0:00:57.12,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些骗人的光阴 我再也不会输给它{\fad(0,600)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.27,0:01:02.76,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睁大眼睛 看清楚这瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.84,0:01:06.90,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它仍然紧紧围绕着我们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.11,0:01:10.91,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人啜泣的 现实生活中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:15.14,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最重要的…到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.35,0:01:18.75,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繁忙的这个世界{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.89,0:01:22.92,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永恒的碎片 忽隐又忽现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.13,0:01:27.00,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去触摸 去捕捉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.16,0:01:32.66,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.11,0:01:38.97,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了得到最后的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.14,0:01:44.98,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.87,0:02:37.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落他…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.67,0:02:40.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷 那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.94,0:02:43.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果真是如此吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.81,0:02:48.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第121话 决战！最强最后的七人帮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.86,0:03:02.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙少主
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:03.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇大姐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.13,0:03:07.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个太慢了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.43,0:03:08.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.47,0:03:09.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙少主
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.10,0:03:12.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算被我们追上了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.67,0:03:14.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么又扔下我们先走嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.61,0:03:16.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地幸亏你们都没事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.94,0:03:17.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.48,0:03:23.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.11,0:03:25.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算舒服多了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.08,0:03:26.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照这情形看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.68,0:03:29.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣地的结界已经完全消除了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.49,0:03:32.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边山上传来一股怪味道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.19,0:03:35.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的臭味
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.76,0:03:39.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且比之前还恶心了几十倍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.40,0:03:40.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.20,0:03:41.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别靠近啦 可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.63,0:03:44.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死妖怪不想活了是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.14,0:03:50.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀…杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.32,0:04:01.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷果然厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.49,0:04:01.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.05,0:04:04.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我也来露两手 人头杖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.93,0:04:11.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管放马过来 老子才不怕
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.33,0:04:13.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油 邪见爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.16,0:04:14.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.38,0:04:26.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.24,0:04:27.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走 又要去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.01,0:04:29.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还用问 去找奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.18,0:04:32.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.02,0:04:34.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.66,0:04:40.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.39,0:04:41.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.46,0:04:47.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不晓得大家是不是都平安
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.46,0:04:49.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心 一定没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.40,0:04:55.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蛮骨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.47,0:04:58.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这是想找我麻烦吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.04,0:05:00.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还用说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.61,0:05:04.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七人帮所有兄弟们 一个个都战死了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.62,0:05:06.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我要替他们讨回公道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.55,0:05:09.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是全都死在我手上 我可不记得
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.99,0:05:11.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过照这样看来不先打败你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.19,0:05:13.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕没办法找到奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.79,0:05:15.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就陪你过几招
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.99,0:05:17.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.13,0:05:20.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.20,0:05:24.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为这么点小玩意 奈何得了我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.44,0:05:26.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,热风
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.45,0:05:39.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不相上下是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.02,0:05:46.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得圣岛决战那一次
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.26,0:05:48.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他虽然就将风之伤封住了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.59,0:05:50.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这次威力更强大
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.83,0:05:52.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蛮骨你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.46,0:05:54.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你身上有你死掉兄弟的四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:57.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些碎片当然全都派上用场了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.04,0:06:00.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可是几个兄弟留给我的纪念品
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.67,0:06:02.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凶骨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.61,0:06:04.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雾骨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.34,0:06:06.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睡骨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.24,0:06:08.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,银骨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.85,0:06:09.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蛇骨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.61,0:06:11.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炼骨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.68,0:06:14.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加上我自己的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.55,0:06:16.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总共有七块碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.42,0:06:19.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多亏如此让我功力倍增呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.49,0:06:22.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.30,0:06:26.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老子没那闲功夫陪你玩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.37,0:06:34.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.95,0:06:43.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太让我惊讶了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:46.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到你这么不堪一击啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:48.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.72,0:06:50.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我变得太强了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.22,0:06:55.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身上有七块四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.29,0:06:57.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,功力也不过如此嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.40,0:07:02.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子 还在那耍嘴皮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.60,0:07:03.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想说大话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.60,0:07:05.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先打赢我再说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.17,0:07:09.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天一定要把你身上的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.11,0:07:13.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个个挖出来 走着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:17.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你这种可恶至极的亡魂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.68,0:07:19.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是乖乖的滚回坟墓长眠去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.92,0:07:22.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长眠的是你才对 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.85,0:07:25.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才是被封印的妖怪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.56,0:07:28.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.13,0:07:29.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说错了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.69,0:07:31.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还不算是妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.19,0:07:32.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是个半妖而已
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.93,0:07:34.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从奈落那边听来的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.77,0:07:35.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于你的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.87,0:07:38.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有桔梗那个死人的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.50,0:07:40.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.65,0:07:51.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个五十年后才被解除封印的半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.02,0:07:54.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么资格批评我们死后复活的事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.15,0:07:56.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:07.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟奈落那家伙聊了不少嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.90,0:08:10.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟是第二次了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.17,0:08:12.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我第二次见到那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:14.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这话什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.17,0:08:17.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一次见到他 是七人帮成立之前
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.04,0:08:19.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在回想起来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.41,0:08:20.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还真是有缘呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.81,0:08:22.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你一直跟奈落同伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.48,0:08:25.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么可能跟一个妖怪同伙呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.82,0:08:28.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得当时 我一心一意想找强者单挑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.99,0:08:31.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就那么凑巧碰上了他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.99,0:08:40.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要够强 是不是妖怪都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:50.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时我听说有个妖怪非常的凶暴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.54,0:08:53.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就走进空无一人的森林找他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.30,0:09:22.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找这森林的主人讨教两招
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.31,0:09:25.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙还真不怕死
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.14,0:09:27.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道就是你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.51,0:09:32.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙是驱魔师还是法师呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.18,0:09:36.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不管什么驱魔不驱魔呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.52,0:09:37.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道如果你够强
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.82,0:09:39.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就陪你过两招
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:42.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是想试试本事多大吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.86,0:09:45.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个天生就有妖力的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.73,0:09:47.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不会懂我想做什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.47,0:09:55.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天生就有妖力是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.24,0:09:57.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么好笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.71,0:10:00.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我也很想得到妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.54,0:10:02.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是个妖怪了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.75,0:10:06.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我一直都在寻找一些
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.32,0:10:09.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不曾拥有的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.89,0:10:17.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.46,0:10:20.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它究竟会不会在人世间重现
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.10,0:10:22.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.34,0:10:33.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,师兄
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.78,0:10:35.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.11,0:10:38.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经全都被打倒啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.88,0:10:42.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么不留一只给我对付嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.43,0:10:55.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是肚子饿了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.17,0:11:00.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蛇骨 不如跟我去打仗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.51,0:11:02.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:05.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是说过不想听命于那些武士吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.88,0:11:07.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是不想听
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.31,0:11:09.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想当个佣兵到处闯荡一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.28,0:11:12.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个有本事的佣兵头子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.78,0:11:14.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说谁敢跟他罗唆呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.55,0:11:18.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就我跟师兄两个人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.66,0:11:22.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来得多找几个伙伴才行喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.26,0:11:28.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下嘛 师兄
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:29.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是认真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.63,0:11:32.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说该找几个伙伴比较好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.81,0:11:37.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然是认真的我也无话好说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.84,0:11:40.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看不如找些帅哥吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.68,0:11:41.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:43.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然是要找功力高强的咯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.68,0:11:47.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.15,0:11:48.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找帅哥来当伙伴的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.15,0:11:51.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就没得享受剁碎他们的快感了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.56,0:11:53.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还真是糊涂呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.10,0:12:03.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来过了很久才再见到他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.70,0:12:06.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再次见面他跟我说了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.20,0:12:10.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落让你们几个复活
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.51,0:12:12.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不是因为顾念旧情
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.01,0:12:14.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是傻瓜吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.01,0:12:16.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.31,0:12:18.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不是那种会顾念旧情的人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.75,0:12:20.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看一眼就知道了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.39,0:12:24.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才是个大笨蛋呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.32,0:12:27.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然自愿被奈落利用作挡箭牌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.89,0:12:29.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都无关紧要
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.53,0:12:30.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要能活着
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.49,0:12:31.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有好多事可以做
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.13,0:12:33.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包括跟你的这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.86,0:12:34.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.74,0:12:46.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好不容易弄到的第二生命
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.71,0:12:48.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次就出动蛮龙要你的命
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.01,0:12:50.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:55.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醒过来吧 蛮骨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.42,0:12:56.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快醒过来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.25,0:12:59.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醒过来吧 蛮骨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.36,0:13:00.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快醒过来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.36,0:13:03.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会让你再活一次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.27,0:13:11.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.44,0:13:13.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于听见我说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.74,0:13:17.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是七人帮里那个叫蛮骨的是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.24,0:13:21.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.18,0:13:24.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是那个时候的妖怪对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.28,0:13:28.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字叫奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.69,0:13:29.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.09,0:13:32.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.92,0:13:35.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们几个兄弟明明被人砍了头
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.79,0:13:39.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里确实是你们的坟墓没错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.77,0:13:53.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在你的体内埋了四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.68,0:13:55.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是碎片的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.81,0:14:00.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到四魂之玉有这种功用
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.45,0:14:02.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须为我效命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.85,0:14:04.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样一来的话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.35,0:14:06.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就能永远地拥有这条性命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.44,0:14:22.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.74,0:14:24.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你的同伴一起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.81,0:14:28.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去杀光我的敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.46,0:14:41.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这跟谁的指使无关
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.73,0:14:50.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没死啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.27,0:14:54.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就别怪我不客气了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.34,0:14:57.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老子就陪你玩一玩 一直到要了你的命为止
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.35,0:15:03.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山就快要崩了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.55,0:15:06.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子 神圣的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.35,0:15:08.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像完全消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.65,0:15:10.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里到处充满了邪气呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.49,0:15:11.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是奈落的邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.52,0:15:14.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且比以前更厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.56,0:15:16.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对 这是股妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.26,0:15:18.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖气越来越浓了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.37,0:15:25.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是…刚刚来过的回廊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.27,0:15:32.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.71,0:15:34.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.10,0:15:57.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.59,0:16:06.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.79,0:16:11.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.10,0:16:17.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.57,0:16:20.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别老盯着下面看 当心脑袋不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.34,0:16:21.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.54,0:16:25.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.31,0:16:27.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落…不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.04,0:16:30.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个时候居然会逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.08,0:16:33.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.35,0:16:36.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子 奈落还没新生完全是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.05,0:16:39.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是在说什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.76,0:16:42.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落之所以大老远跑到白灵山
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.86,0:16:44.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说穿了是因为
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.26,0:16:46.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被犬夜叉的红色铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.20,0:16:48.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,破除了原本自身的结界吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.47,0:16:52.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的结界 居然…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.34,0:16:54.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以奈落那个家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.50,0:16:56.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利用这个地方 不断重组自己的肉体
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:16:58.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想让自己更壮大对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.38,0:17:01.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉 法师
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:04.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是什么都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.61,0:17:07.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙根本一点都不信任我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.05,0:17:09.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于奈落的事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.32,0:17:11.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好问这位神无
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.35,0:17:13.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过她应该也不会说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.33,0:17:17.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底知道多少 一五一十跟我说清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.89,0:17:20.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如用自己的双眼去确认吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.90,0:17:22.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到这底下去确认
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.33,0:17:24.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这我倒是可以帮帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.09,0:17:52.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么下去没完没了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.86,0:17:53.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.86,0:17:55.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果蛮骨这家伙是妖怪的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.73,0:17:57.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还可用爆流破让他粉身碎骨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.83,0:17:59.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.37,0:18:00.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喘不过气了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.44,0:18:03.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是这家伙原本是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.64,0:18:05.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然说是邪恶的亡魂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.01,0:18:07.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蛮骨身上并没有妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.61,0:18:09.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.85,0:18:12.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以卷起对手的妖气来反击的爆流破
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.32,0:18:13.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来用不上了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.89,0:18:21.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.89,0:18:22.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真亏他想得出这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.83,0:18:26.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利用人类的亡魂当替死鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.96,0:18:29.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜不到你到底在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.37,0:18:30.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过今天要死的人是你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.63,0:18:31.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.60,0:18:35.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本以为可以一刀就要你的命
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.47,0:18:36.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.91,0:18:38.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只好多陪你玩两招了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.18,0:18:47.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么会这样呢 钢牙少主
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.05,0:18:50.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白灵山所有草木全都枯死了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.72,0:18:55.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概是受奈落的瘴气影响吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.16,0:18:58.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉到四魂之玉碎片了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.19,0:19:00.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且…有两个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.50,0:19:02.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个在山下 一个在山腰上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.70,0:19:04.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有两个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.00,0:19:07.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山腰上那块好像比较大
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.34,0:19:09.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概是奈落吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.84,0:19:10.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.57,0:19:11.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.24,0:19:12.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由你来带路吧 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.51,0:19:17.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛走那么快 钢牙少主
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.48,0:19:18.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.35,0:19:20.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.15,0:19:22.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别扔下我们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.59,0:19:27.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个死妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.16,0:19:30.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别挡着我们的路
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.03,0:19:35.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死妖怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.00,0:19:38.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尝到苦头了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.17,0:19:40.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道我们的厉害了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.47,0:19:45.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙少主
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.38,0:19:47.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇大姐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.28,0:19:53.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的扔下我们自己先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.35,0:20:01.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 珊瑚 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.26,0:20:02.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们可千万不能有事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.41,0:20:22.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.78,0:20:25.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落明明就在这前面
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.82,0:20:28.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.75,0:20:31.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是说要取我命的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.99,0:20:33.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.59,0:20:36.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么下去一定打不过蛮骨的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.93,0:20:40.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是没耐性一直陪你玩下去的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.03,0:20:42.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.23,0:20:46.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来这场游戏差不多该结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.81,0:20:55.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么 散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.62,0:21:02.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.02,0:21:07.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来真的藏在手臂上
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.32,0:21:10.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪不得一双手这么有力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.56,0:21:12.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,误打误中被我猜到了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.10,0:21:14.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,侥幸而已
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.56,0:21:16.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算你走运 臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.33,0:21:18.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你身体里的四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.94,0:21:21.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就一个个帮你全挖出来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.34,0:21:22.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来轮到脖子了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.45,0:21:38.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有这么容易吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.59,0:21:39.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.86,0:21:41.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,未免太小看本大爷了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.33,0:21:46.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.10,0:21:51.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是七人帮老大 蛮骨大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.33,0:21:53.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对不会输给任何人的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.52,0:22:13.11,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}偷偷亲你一下 装作若无其事的样子{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.26,0:22:18.59,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我这样调皮 是不是像个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.69,0:22:24.86,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早已习惯 被你说是娇嗔无理
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.93,0:22:31.10,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过 「喜欢你」 这三个字却始终说不出口
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.21,0:22:34.01,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}My Sweet Emotion{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.51,0:22:45.39,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对着镜子 多看一次 看看自己的微笑{\fad(400,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.16,0:22:58.19,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果想飞奔出去追求刺激就得挺起胸膛向前走
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.24,0:23:08.70,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大胆放手去做 直到满意为止{\fad(0,800)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.95,0:23:18.62,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}偷偷亲你一下 装作若无其事的样子{\fad(400,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.72,0:23:24.06,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我这样调皮 是不是像个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.19,0:23:30.22,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早已习惯 被你说是娇嗔无理
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.40,0:23:36.43,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过 「喜欢你」 这三个字却始终说不出口
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.57,0:23:39.17,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}My Sweet Emotion{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.97,0:23:52.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片的气息越来越脏了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.10,0:23:54.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白灵山里到底出了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.00,0:23:57.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些是肉球吗 不像是妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.51,0:23:59.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子好像会变出什么来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.68,0:24:01.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底奈落真正的目的是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.84,0:24:03.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去杀光我的敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.51,0:24:05.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,血染人类跟妖怪共两千
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.58,0:24:07.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你敌得过这把吸足怨念的蛮龙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.49,0:24:10.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.99,0:24:13.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凶猛蛮龙 白灵山上的死斗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.52,0:24:14.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一股充满邪气的妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.02,0:24:17.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 这把剑威力真强
